## 11. Conclusion

The Drupal and MySQL infrastructure was successfully deployed on Kubernetes.

Persistent storage was configured using a 5Gi PersistentVolume and a 3Gi PersistentVolumeClaim. MySQL was deployed using `mysql:5.7`, with persistent storage mounted at `/var/lib/mysql`. Drupal was deployed using the requested `drupal:8.6` image.

Both application Deployments reached their desired ready state. The MySQL Service exposed port 3306 internally, while the Drupal Service exposed the application through NodePort 30095.

The environment was prepared for the development team to proceed with the Drupal installation.

